OL,7,G1915FBolton: The Happiest Town on
OL,8,     FEarth?
OL,9,     G'What is happiness?' The people
OL,10,     Gof Bolton were asked this
OL,11,     Gquestion in the 1930s as part of
OL,12,     Ga mass observation. We return to
OL,13,     GBolton to find out if they have
OL,14,     Gthe answer.
